  "Promised Meeting": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK. Gain $2 [Shiny Points] and enter [Idol Business] state for $3 turns.\\n[Idol Business]: Increase Crit Rate by <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> and DMG Bonus by <color=#FFFC40>$5</color>. Before the start of turn, gain $6 [Shiny Points].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Tossing a candy into the coffee cup～! Melting in a heartbeat～ is the sweet magic ❤ Let the foe feel～ my charming flavor!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to all foes equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK, distribute this damage between all foes. \\nAfter using this skill in [Idol Business] mode: Double Narumi's [Shiny Points].\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>Time to fire the giant cream cake-! Convey this love's super technique! It's our secret code-!</color></size></b>": "",
  "Deal Psy damage to 1 foe equal to <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> of ATK.\\nWhen [Naruru ♪ Naruru ♫] is active: Deal bonus Psy damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> of ATK for every [Shiny Points] stacks. When [Shiny Points] stacks reach $3, deal bonus Psy damage equal to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> of ATK. Also gain $5 DMG Bonus when activating this skill.\\n<b><size=28><color=#850101>I'm everyone's {{A}} ♪ Support and cheer for me～ Let's flood the chat! This love-powered stage ♪ Please keep your eyes on me!</color></size></b>": "",
